WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:02.080
(romantic guitar music)

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.399
(laughing)

00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:10.535
- I have a feeling that
novellas are similar

00:00:10.535 --> 00:00:12.171
to American soap operas.

00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:14.458
- Someone's always sleeping with somebody,

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.053
somebody killed somebody's uncle.

00:00:16.053 --> 00:00:19.227
- People too sexy for what
they're doing, is that possible?

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:22.141
- [Voiceover] I feel like
this is just a really

00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:25.182
heightened version of a lot
of Bravo's reality shows.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:30.064
- Their makeup is just a little too much.

00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:32.827
(laughing) Like, that eyeshadow game.

00:00:32.827 --> 00:00:35.451
- They're all wearing like,
cartoon clothes, you know?

00:00:35.451 --> 00:00:37.448
- I'm 20 seconds into this show,

00:00:37.448 --> 00:00:39.828
and already, my mind is blown.

00:00:39.828 --> 00:00:42.870
- And why are there so
many closeups? (laughing)

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.401
- This lady is trying to attack
a small girl in a wheelchair

00:00:46.401 --> 00:00:47.390
because she was...

00:00:47.393 --> 00:00:49.200
Oh! The wheelchair got knocked over!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.837
- It kind of reminds me of when Solange

00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:52.660
went after Jay-Z in that elevator.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:56.340
- Oh, she killed the old lady! Oh, (beep)!

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.191
- Oh, no! She has the scissors.

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:00.719
Oh, what's going to happen? Oh my god.

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:02.554
- I think he's dying
because she stabbed him

00:01:02.554 --> 00:01:05.685
in the arm, which, like, come on.

00:01:05.685 --> 00:01:06.939
- People have entered the room

00:01:06.939 --> 00:01:08.936
to watch this kid bleed to death.

00:01:08.936 --> 00:01:11.397
- Everyone's just crying
and yelling and screaming,

00:01:11.397 --> 00:01:14.033
and they just keep doing
closeups of everyone's face.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.612
Just like, ah!

00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:19.908
- This is basically like
WWE, but in a Latin version.

00:01:19.908 --> 00:01:22.915
- The same two people died in
like a matter of four minutes.

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:27.665
- [Voiceover] "La Usurpadora",
so it's basically like

00:01:27.665 --> 00:01:29.987
their version of Mary-Kate and Ashley"?

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:32.469
- These intros are too much for me.

00:01:32.469 --> 00:01:35.244
Like I would have already flipped
the channel at this point.

00:01:35.244 --> 00:01:37.264
- Characters are either
like, not paying attention

00:01:37.264 --> 00:01:40.259
to the camera at all, or
just looking deep into it.

00:01:40.259 --> 00:01:42.221
- There's like this
really ridiculous music

00:01:42.221 --> 00:01:43.437
playing in the background.

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:46.833
- I can't count, there's
been like 20 characters.

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:49.934
- This is also long, like,
why is this intro still going?

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:51.224
- I like the musical cues.

00:01:51.224 --> 00:01:52.555
I wish I could have that in real life,

00:01:52.555 --> 00:01:53.948
just when I walk in the room.

00:01:53.948 --> 00:01:55.655
- Loco, I know that.

00:01:55.655 --> 00:01:57.698
- They really like mirrors on this show.

00:01:57.698 --> 00:01:59.451
Like, if there's a camera angle

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:01.994
on one person, there's
a mirror behind them,

00:02:01.994 --> 00:02:04.235
where you could like
still see the other guy.

00:02:04.235 --> 00:02:05.628
- She just did the thing where you like,

00:02:05.628 --> 00:02:06.917
you're facing away from someone,

00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:08.622
and he's talking at you back
here, and then you just go...

00:02:10.084 --> 00:02:12.666
- She's like, "Let me give
you this one last kiss."

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:15.127
"Remember me fondly,
because you ain't never

00:02:15.127 --> 00:02:16.514
"going to find a (beep) like this."

00:02:16.514 --> 00:02:19.423
- Rubbing his thumbs on her chin,

00:02:19.423 --> 00:02:20.842
because he's going in for a kiss.

00:02:20.842 --> 00:02:23.268
But she's like, "Oh,no.
You're goatee looks gross."

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:25.973
- She looks like she does
not want this kiss at all.

00:02:25.973 --> 00:02:27.937
It's making me really uncomfortable.

00:02:27.937 --> 00:02:30.022
- I don't like one sided kissing.

00:02:30.022 --> 00:02:31.019
- Like, you know you're supposed to go 90,

00:02:31.019 --> 00:02:33.771
and she's supposed to go 10?
He definitely went like 95

00:02:33.771 --> 00:02:36.730
and she went five and it was strange.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.806
- I mean, I get why
people get hooked to these

00:02:38.806 --> 00:02:41.450
because, literally, anything can happen.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.691
(romantic guitar music)

